  "reading_path_observations": [
    "Read SKILL.md then Author mode, canon prerequisites/terms/criteria/scope, the complete canon map and walk rules, design flow, the complete change-surface lifecycle, planning, audit dispatch and the typed receipt template.",
    "Coordinator owns scope capture and audit commands; this worker reads assigned packets and writes only its own receipts and transcript.",
    "Packet projection preserves each complete unique criterion, source excerpt and row record, grouped by exact serialized identity; equal source hashes permit cross-packet reuse. Both source variants and all distinct row addresses were read.",
